    "html": "<p>Two charged parallel plates have electric potentials of 10 V and 20 V.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>A particle with charge +2.0 μC is moved from the 10 V plate to the 20 V plate. What is the change in the electric potential energy of the particle?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\">−20 μJ</li><li data-label=\"B\">−10 μJ</li><li data-label=\"C\">10 μJ</li><li data-label=\"D\">20 μJ</li></ol>"
  },
